.TH MYSTRCPY 3 "September 2026" "OS Assignment 01" "Library Functions"

.SH NAME
mystrcpy \- copy a string into another string

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.br
.B int mystrcpy(char *dest, const char *src);

.SH DESCRIPTION
The mystrcpy function copies the string pointed to by src into the destination buffer pointed to by dest.

